 into a vital hub for your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/edad256df8b3f47d6091d1a6a546c71a.avif?t=1746550521\" width=652 height=92 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/d53e47cca5cbcf636f180d4fb742811e.poster.avif?t=1746550521\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/d53e47cca5cbcf636f180d4fb742811e.webm?t=1746550521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/d53e47cca5cbcf636f180d4fb742811e.mp4?t=1746550521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Choose your strategy: become a leader in mass budget transportation or create an elite service for demanding customers. A variety of classes allows you to customize comfort and pricing, gaining passenger trust and loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/1ac04999c4a7c8b806b8de11ed6494d4.avif?t=1746550521\" width=652 height=92 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/34c057a347579a8ab5524f90192341a6.poster.avif?t=1746550521\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/34c057a347579a8ab5524f90192341a6.webm?t=1746550521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/34c057a347579a8ab5524f90192341a6.mp4?t=1746550521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build 